:: Robin Water Dragon
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>>
Feeling safe and happy as you relax with Robin, little squeaks and clicks bubble up your throat and your tail starts to wag.
Robin pauses <<his>> game to look over at you in surprise. "You sound like a dolphin!" <<he>> giggles,
and you can't help but to laugh along with <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<He>> takes a breath and attempts to replicate the sound. <<Hes>> not great at first, but you squeak and
click along with <<him>> until <<he>> almost gets the hang of it. You go back and forth for a time, enjoying the moment.
<br><br>

<<robinoptions>>

:: Robin Talk Transgender
<<endevent>>
<<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<run $transgenderknown.pushUnique("Robin")>>
You take a breath and tell Robin that you're trans. You explain that the way other people describe your body does not decide who you are, and that being treated like a crossdresser when you're only trying to live as yourself hurts.
<br><br>
Robin listens without interrupting. <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 70>>When you finish, <<he>> takes your hand firmly. "I understand, I want you to tell me what makes you comfortable. I don't want anyone else deciding who you're supposed to be."
<br><br>
The possessive edge in <<his>> voice makes it clear that <<he>> still wants a say of <<his>> own.<<else>>When you finish, <<he>> takes your hand carefully. "Thank you for telling me," <<he>> says. "You don't have to prove anything to me. If there's something I can do that would help, I want you to tell me."<</if>> <<stress -6>><<lstress>><<npcincr Robin love 2>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<robinoptions>>